                <pb facs="0416" n="400" sameAs="frus:frus1947v08/pg400"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">701.6132/10–2447: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Brazil</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Key</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Rio de Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-10-24T18:00:00-03:00">October 24, 1947—6
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1471. Moscow’s 3084, October 23 to Department.<anchor n="23" xml:id="d354-f1"/>
                    Called on Secretary General Foreign Office at noon today and drew his attention
                    to complications created by inadequate police protection of Soviet Embassy
                    premises Rio. I expressed hope that no further similar incidents would occur and
                    enquired whether precautions were being taken in view of the large demonstration
                    of solidarity scheduled for this afternoon in front of Catete Palace and danger
                    that some of participants might afterwards demonstrate before Soviet Embassy.
                        <pb facs="0417" n="401" xml:id="pg401"/> Accioly stated that he would
                    immediately telephone police to post adequate guard around Soviet Embassy
                    premises.</p>
                <p>Department relay Moscow.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Key</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
